'''Poké Ball''' (Japanese: '''モンスターボール''' ''Monster Ball'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Put 1 random Basic Pokémon from your deck into your hand.
}}

==Release information==
Poké Ball cards were first made available to purchase from the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand) for 2 Shop Tickets each. An ultra rare print of the Poké Ball card was later included in the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion, which was available worldwide from March 27, 2025.

