==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the EX Series and Stormfront prints of the {{TCG|Great Ball}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card chooses the Basic Pokémon randomly.
** {{TCG|Poké Ball}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but its effect is not specific to Basic Pokémon, and it requires tossing heads to successfully use its effect.

===Origin===
* This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Poké Ball|125}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
* The {{i|Poké Ball}} is an item in the [[Pokémon games]] used to capture [[wild Pokémon]].

